CHECK_A|packages/temper-io-types/src/placer_core/netclass.rs|POWER_PIN_PATTERNS|packages/temper-placer/src/temper_placer/core/net_classification.py  # reason: same as GROUND_NET_PATTERNS above — hard-coded pattern set, not a call-site parameter, cross-checked by test_core_contracts_differential.py.
